Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.90,H_ms,,0,0,0,,Sistem hantar otai gym ke zaman lampau... jadi ahli strategi?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.90,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya cari makan dengan otak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tadi awak angkat batu berat dengan tangan kosong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,dan awak kata itu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:05.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Pernah latihan silat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tak pernah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:07.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,saya gym cuma nak cari makan —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:09.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,otot bukan seni bela diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,tapi dalam diriku ada pasukan sejuta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,naga tersembunyi zaman ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:14.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Salahkan sistem jahat ni:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:16.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,suruh rekrut ahli strategi dalam 3 hari —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kalau gagal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,saya jadi sida!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ini soal maruah lelaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,mati pun mesti jadi ahli strategi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Satria Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,masuk bawah saya jadi ketua tentera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,saya jamin kemuliaanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya pamit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau Tuanku paksa saya jadi askar kasar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,akan saya abdi pada tuan lebih bijak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Satria,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kalau pergi kem musuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:33.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kerajaan kita halang dengan apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:36.19,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Aku,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,setuju.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:38.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, Tuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:39.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Hamba akan berbakti habis-habisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:40.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,dan merancang strategi buat tuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:41.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,[Ding!]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:42.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tahniah, tuan rumah: ahli strategi direkrut!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Misi sistem selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:45.89,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ganjaran sedang dihantar...
